{"product_id":"the-food-doctor-for-babies-and-children-nutritional-food-for-healthy-development","title":"The Food Doctor for Babies and Children Nutritional Food for Healthy Development","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Food Doctor for Babies \u0026amp; Children provides a sensible, practical aid to ensure that your child has a balanced and nutritionally sensible diet.   Every parent wants the best for their child, and \"The Food Doctor for Babies \u0026amp; Children\" gives invaluable information about the foods and nutrients children require for optimum health, maximum energy, immunity, brain growth and healthy bones. Including carefully researched meal planners and delicious recipes \"The Food Doctor for Babies \u0026amp; Children\" introduces nutritious foods that will give your child the best start in life.   The book provides expert advice on nutrition for growing children, from birth through adolescence, it also identifies and helps children with food allergies and intolerances. Behavioural problems and links to food are examined. Delicious recipes and meal planners including first foods, family meals and easy options are featured too.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 191 x 260\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Vicki Edgson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781843400004\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820906930329,"sku":"17RC-59781843400004","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68fa0bdfc29c1_The_Food_Doctor_for_Babies_and_Children_Nutritional_Food_for_Healthy_Development_Vicki_Edgson.jpg?v=1761234492","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-food-doctor-for-babies-and-children-nutritional-food-for-healthy-development","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}